553
00:43:03.358 --> 00:43:05.567
Pivonka!
Pivonka!

554
00:43:05.842 --> 00:43:08.155
Pivonka!

555
00:43:35.442 --> 00:43:36.442
Da.

556
00:43:36.983 --> 00:43:38.239
Pivonka!

557
00:43:39.817 --> 00:43:42.160
