566
00:44:37.783 --> 00:44:40.413
We dance and get that map.

567
00:44:42.202 --> 00:44:43.311
Here we go.

568
00:44:45.710 --> 00:44:48.050
Okay, now let's do.
No, we're gonna go...

569
00:44:55.037 --> 00:44:56.326
Okay.

570
00:45:05.034 --> 00:45:09.076
