575
00:45:25.464 --> 00:45:26.464
Freaks!

576
00:45:27.193 --> 00:45:28.642
Freaks!

577
00:45:28.643 --> 00:45:30.828
Freaks! Freaks! Freaks!

578
00:45:30.943 --> 00:45:33.109
Freaks! Freaks! Freaks!

579
00:45:33.111 --> 00:45:35.400
Freaks! Freaks! Freaks!

580
00:45:35.401 --> 00:45:37.032
Freaks! Freaks! Freaks!

581
