605
00:48:07.943 --> 00:48:09.359
Of course, buddy.

606
00:48:12.651 --> 00:48:14.253
Comin' in hot.

607
00:48:14.568 --> 00:48:17.276
Growing up, I didn't have any friends.

608
00:48:17.366 --> 00:48:20.283
