Like vin diesel and the rock.

643
00:51:12.237 --> 00:51:13.537
Wait for me.

644
00:51:20.068 --> 00:51:24.318
Okay, giant owl door, giant owl.
Makes sense.

645
00:51:35.601 --> 00:51:38.584
Wait a second.
I've seen these symbols before.

646
